.BI \-rankConflict
Weight for conflict\-graph degree in strong branching sort\-key (0 = disabled).
.br
Range: 0 to 100 (default: 0)
.TP
.BI \-rankConflictPowerTrusted
Scaling exponent for conflict score when pseudo\-costs are trusted (sqrt = 0.5).
